cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the information provided in this file."
type: software
title: "Scoliosis Severity Assessment from Spinal X-rays: Mask R-CNN Vertebra Segmentation and Geometric Cobb Angle Estimation"

authors:
  - family-names: "ARAB"
    given-names: "Malha-Thilelli"
    affiliation: "Mouloud Mammeri University of Tizi Ouzou, Algeria"
  - family-names: "HAMDAOUI"
    given-names: "Manel"
    affiliation: "Mouloud Mammeri University of Tizi Ouzou, Algeria"

abstract: >-
  Research software developed as part of a Master's thesis at
  Mouloud Mammeri University of Tizi Ouzou, Algeria, under the
  supervision of Dr. Nadhir NOUIOUA. The pipeline combines
  Mask R-CNN vertebra instance segmentation, geometric Cobb
  angle estimation, and angle-based scoliosis severity classification.

repository-code: "https://github.com/Hamdaoui-Arab-Master-Thesis/automated-scoliosis-detection-classification"

license: MIT

keywords:
  - scoliosis
  - vertebra segmentation
  - Mask R-CNN
  - Cobb angle
  - geometric estimation
  - medical image analysis
  - deep learning
  - Master's thesis
